# urlwatch's snapshot cache. NEVER commit this.
#
# It grew by roughly 45 MB per run and hit GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file
# limit on 19 Sep 2026, at which point every run was rejected at push and
# stopped saving its state - so each morning diffed against a three-day-old
# snapshot without saying so. It lives in the Actions cache instead; see the
# restore/save steps in .github/workflows/watch.yml.
cache.db

# Local scratch
__pycache__/
*.pyc
